lass=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, Charlton County&rsquo;s record runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, March to April and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years. In 2025, September to October came in at 20% of normal and October to November at 28% on the middle of the grids. Grid 13091 had its driest year in 1954 at 54% of normal.</p>"}
